      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::*Weapon information:*

*Lethal mode:*
Energy per pulse: 240J
Pulses per shot: 50 
Pulse delay per shot: 10 µs
Total energy output per shot: 12kJ

*Less-lethal mode (default):*
Energy per pulse: 2.4kJ
Pulses per shot: 20
Pulse delay per shot: 25 µs
Total energy output per shot: 48kJ

Note: energy "shot" as defined under section 4.8 of BCMS/5.3 UPMS::&lt;end&gt;</source>
